# The pictures of mass.md: the pin, the bored plate and the hollowed
# box of examples/scripts/clearance (testdata/solid/clearance.tlspr),
# the plate made aluminium and the pin steel. The property browser is
# widened so that the density shows at the end of the appearance row.
file $testdata/solid/clearance.tlspr
menu File|Open...
size tw 800 600
view rotated
menu View|Zoom To Fit
cursor on
twmove 200 220
mark 128 210 100 22 tw
shot mass-1-groups
twdown L 200 220
twup L 200 220
twmove 676 245
mark 495 240 258 22 tw
shot mass-2-density tw
twdown L 676 245
twup L 676 245
edit 2.7
cursor off
mark 495 240 258 22 tw
shot mass-3-set tw
twmove 30 5
twdown L 30 5
twup L 30 5
twmove 200 295
twdown L 200 295
twup L 200 295
twmove 676 245
twdown L 676 245
twup L 676 245
edit 7.85
answer ok
menu Analyze|Measure Volume
